OL,3,AFourth arrest after Halloween party
OL,4,Astabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old from Southampton has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,8,Fmurder. Police have been given an extra
OL,9,F36 hours to question a 16 and
OL,10,F17-year-old, also from the city, who
OL,11,Fwere held on Monday morning on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of the same offence.
